        "Developers building RAG and semantic search",
        "Python and JavaScript AI developers",
        "Teams prototyping LLM apps"
      ],
      "whyChoose": "Choose it for a tiny API, automatic embedding, and a path from in-memory prototype to a server or the hosted Chroma Cloud.",
      "requirements": [
        "Python (pip) or Node.js (npm)"
      ]
    },
    "overview": [
      "Install the Python client with pip install chromadb, or the JavaScript client with npm install chromadb. For client-server mode run chroma run with a data path.",
      "The core API is four functions: create a client, create a collection, add documents with ids and metadata, and query with text. You can also bring your own embeddings.",
      "Chroma Cloud is the hosted option with serverless vector, hybrid and full-text search. The open-source project is Apache 2.0 licensed."
